  "releaseNotes": "Housekeeping\n\n- SyntaxFactoryHelper's files are named for what they hold (#509, closes #478). The generator's syntax helpers are regrouped into files whose names say what they hold (Arithmetic, Directives, Literals, Assignment, Statements), every helper is internal, and small noise in them is removed. The generated output is byte-identical on every supported Roslyn version.\n\nThis completes the generator cleanups that 1.0.12 shipped.",
